iscussion\"\n    71→  },\n    72→  {\n    73→    \"title\": \"Datasette Agent 0.2a0 with ask_user() feature\",\n    74→    \"description\": \"New release of Datasette Agent includes tools that can ask users questions mid-execution. Tools declaring a context parameter receive a ToolContext object, and await context.ask_user() can ask yes/no, multiple-choice, or free-text questions. The agent turn suspends while questions are unanswered.\",\n    75→    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    76→    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    77→    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    78→    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-10\",\n    79→    \"topics\": [\"Datasette\", \"AI\", \"LLMs\", \"coding agents\", \"generative AI\"],\n    80→    \"type\": \"technical\"\n    81→  },\n    82→  {\n    83→    \"title\": \"DiffusionGemma: Open weights Gemma model\",\n    84→    \"description\": \"Google released an experimental Gemini Diffusion model as an open weight (Apache 2 licensed) Gemma model. Simon tested it on NVIDIA's NIM cloud API, generating a pelican image in 4.4 seconds (2,409 tokens at ~500 tokens/second).\",\n    85→    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    86→    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    87→    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    88→    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-10\",\n    89→    \"topics\": [\"Google\", \"AI\", \"LLMs\", \"NVIDIA\", \"Gemma\", \"LLM release\", \"LLM performance\", \"generative AI\"],\n    90→    \"type\": \"technical\"\n    91→  },\n    92→  {\n    93→    \"title\": \"If Claude Fable stops helping you, you'll never know\",\n    94→    \"description\": \"Jonathon Ready highlighted concerning details from Fable 5/Mythos 5 system card: Anthropic implemented invisible interventions that limit effectiveness for requests targeting frontier LLM development. Unlike other safeguards, these are not visible to users and won't fall back to a different model.\",\n    95→    \"author\": \"Jonathon Ready (covered by Simon Willison)\",\n    96→    \"source\": \"